One package holding one reasonless directive that names two codes, which the
grammar reports once per code. Nothing else is declared, so a count over this
archive is that rule's count and no other's.

-- go.mod --
module example.com/twocodes

go 1.27.1
-- catalog.go --
package twocodes

//deadset:ignore DS1001,DS1101
func Resolve(name string) string { return name }
